{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-039","published":"2026-06-03T16:10:48Z","modified":"2026-09-10T03:46:00.761217484Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-10768"],"details":"This module configures default editorial workflows for LocalGov Drupal content types. It provides a Drupal content moderation workflow, a content approvals dashboard, content scheduling and content preview.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently restrict access to a view of Service Contacts at which exposes the names and content items assigned to each Service Contact.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/localgov_workflows","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/localgov_workflows?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.6.0"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<1.6.0"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<1.6.0","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/localgov_workflows/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-039.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-039"}],"credits":[{"name":"Maria Young (maria.y)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/mariay-0"]}]}